	(text "Ioff buffer prevents MCU back-power when main supply is off.\nCT=1nF, VBIAS=5V: 1.33ms typical 3.3V rise (TI Table 1).\nQuick-output discharge 225R typical; measured decay required."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0af4d867-03a9-5aba-aec8-24e0215a3314")
	)
	(text "G33: open CT gives 12–28ms delay to clock-enable logic.\nG01: CT via 100k to VDD gives 180–420ms reset delay.\n0.871V nominal core supervision; worst release <=0.925V.\nThis detects collapse; it does not guarantee the .92V operating minimum.\nHold PERST for >=100ms with clock stable. Verify all corners on bench."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 365.76 375.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "de50d8b9-0bc5-5394-a2ae-97a5f27414d7")
	)
	(text "0.954V nominal; .588–.612V FB and 0.1% R: 0.934–0.974V.\nRTL8125BG .92–.98V operating rail, 650mA maximum (Table 29).\nPOW_EXT_SWR controls core startup; do not fit RTL8125BGS here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 335.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ef8d6671-88e0-594f-9c49-1433bcabfa13")
	)
